# project: season3-liveops
VAR drops_shipped = 0

=== season_kickoff ===
Season 3 content is planned and locked as three content drops.
Team is staffed and drop 1 production is ready to begin.
* [Kick off drop production] -> drop_build

=== drop_build ===
Build the current drop's content: featured mode, events, and rewards.
Done means a release candidate build exists for QA.
+ [Build complete, ready for QA] -> drop_qa

=== drop_qa ===
Internal QA on the drop's release candidate.
Done means no blocking issues remain and the drop is cleared to ship.
+ [QA passes, cleared to ship] -> drop_ship
+ [QA finds blocking issues, back to build] ~loop~ -> drop_build

=== drop_ship ===
Ship the drop to the live game.
~ drops_shipped += 1
+ [Drop is live] -> live_watch

=== live_watch ===
Watch retention and revenue KPIs and crash rates for the drop's first live week.
Done means the first week has closed with the drop stable.
+ [Crashes or instability detected] -> hotfix
+ [First week closed, KPIs at or above target] -> drop_review
+ [Crashes stabilized but KPIs under target] -> kpi_remediation

=== hotfix ===
Develop and deploy a hotfix for the drop's crashes; as many hotfixes as it takes to stabilize.
+ [Hotfix deployed, resume watching KPIs] ~loop~ -> live_watch

=== kpi_remediation ===
The drop is stable but KPIs remain under target after stabilization.
The live-ops lead chooses the remediation path.
+ [Run a compensation event] @human -> comp_event
+ [Pull the drop's featured mode] @human -> pull_featured_mode

=== comp_event ===
Run the compensation event to win back retention and revenue for the affected drop.
+ [Event run, drop closed out] -> drop_review

=== pull_featured_mode ===
Pull the drop's featured mode from the live game and communicate the change to players.
+ [Mode pulled, drop closed out] -> drop_review

=== drop_review ===
The drop's first live week is closed out; route to the next stage of the season.
+ {drops_shipped < 2} [Start the next drop] ~loop~ -> drop_build
+ {drops_shipped == 2} [Mid-season checkpoint on cumulative KPIs] -> midseason_review
+ {drops_shipped >= 3} [All drops shipped, wrap the season] -> season_wrap

=== midseason_review ===
The studio head reviews cumulative season KPIs and sets the season's course.
+ [Extend the season by a month] @human ~loop~ -> drop_build
+ [End on schedule, ship the final drop] @human ~loop~ -> drop_build
+ [End early, pivot the team to season 4 pre-production] @human -> s4_preprod

=== s4_preprod ===
The season winds down early and the team pivots to season 4 pre-production.
* [Team pivoted, season closed] -> season_wrap

=== season_wrap ===
Season retrospective: what the drops and KPIs taught us, feeding the season 4 greenlight decision.
* [Greenlight season 4] @human -> END
* [Do not greenlight season 4] @human -> END
